flowchart TD
    A[Approved FOG correction template] --> B[Bounded text analysis]
    B --> C[Simulated keyboard, screen-reader, reflow, and offline checks]
    C --> D{All essential accessibility checks pass?}
    D -->|No| E[ACCESSIBILITY_REVIEW_REQUIRED]
